                 "view":  {
                              "value":  "\u003cp local-id=\"a3f474c9c4bd\"\u003eoriginal story: \u003ca href=\"/wiki/spaces/Phoenix/pages/610926593/Phase+2+-+Mass+communication+SMS+API\" data-linked-resource-id=\"610926593\" data-linked-resource-version=\"3\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\"\u003ePhase 2 - Mass communication SMS API\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"5c61d5571410\" /\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"4d0c30d8b45c\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUser story\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"0e391ca7049d\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAs a\u003c/strong\u003e system user,\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eI want\u003c/strong\u003e Phoenix to use the updated Mass communication SMS API,\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSo that\u003c/strong\u003e SMS are sent and tracked correctly through the new SMS provider integration.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"1c535c76f6ae\"\u003eÂ \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"115f747edcde\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAcceptance criteria\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"de0a119975c9\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGeneral\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"327f71a4-f155-4abf-afef-900aa21801cb\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"d67e7874-eadd-4aec-9efe-71e5d1569224\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"c185b9be850a\"\u003eAll SMS API calls use base URL port 3955 (not 3950).\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"08a655a6-084c-40b5-aedd-61ccbdf9e87d\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"8bdd6f898eea\"\u003eAll SMS API calls include mandatory query parameter company in the URL.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"3011c99e-f646-4a3d-a306-3fdf36ecde1a\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"cbe082824315\"\u003eFor Mass communication SMS, Phoenix uses company=5 (ENERGO-PRO Energy Services) unless another company is explicitly required.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"147482b7-e340-4678-a0e4-d51c573fcbef\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"6a37eb3e7032\"\u003eThe same company value is used for the full flow of one batch (create package â send packages â status check).\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"f55481927dba\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompany parameter\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"e844053d-0035-4fad-b531-6dea6a2d0d30\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"eadb30be-bf56-4aec-ac36-504eaef493bb\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"b926ed4e0816\"\u003eAllowed values are documented and supported:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"6417dd8b-3868-42ef-8014-6509ee596b7d\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"0cb12814-4283-4baf-a11b-ddd292667489\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"69f8a6a11601\"\u003e5 â ENERGO-PRO Energy Services\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"21e50b06-9fc5-48c7-90fd-3d0d08accc4a\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"d8aff3982086\"\u003e3 â ENERGO-PRO Sales\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"2b4ebf65-5e06-49f6-b475-5eb8c4ff1f3c\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"0388bbc3d42b\"\u003e1 â Electrodistribution North\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"28c32f98-fa68-47c1-9317-b94fbe7a2f8d\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"f82ac737dcca\"\u003ecompany is sent on every endpoint: sendSMS, insSMS, mulltiInsSMS, sendAprSMS, statusSMS.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"f323ef00d225\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSending SMS\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"d4d71e60-0f96-4db5-98b5-74ba4386a926\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"43a55a62-2495-43d9-95b5-df0b20c016fd\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"1bfb29fabdae\"\u003eSingle SMS (1 message)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"0eeb3f7e-2d41-47c6-9d21-b33cb3e954e6\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"4257e929-b008-4eb7-a962-a16444d6d9cf\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"8794d2194fd3\"\u003ePhoenix calls: buffer_import_sms/sendSMS?company={value}\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"ca43f731-802c-4a2c-a7a2-48d8d81dc1a7\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"537b721ba8c0\"\u003eRequest: import_id (Phoenix SMS id), customer phone, SMS body\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"f29dd4e2-77bf-4a03-ae09-684310e5d621\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"32051f6a1d7f\"\u003eResponse: id is stored in Phoenix for status check\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"bc6b81bd-4eb2-4847-9e41-f7d56b259a76\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"7b9c1090da72\"\u003eMultiple SMS (2â10 messages)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"61ee7996-29c0-49e8-8f39-9eb25facc6ae\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"01061d75-8e72-4272-8a81-01ac2f18c3e9\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"2a3b4a2a4bce\"\u003ePhoenix calls: buffer_import_sms/insSMS?company={value}\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"45c17793-1df4-41cc-bbdc-df1de3ce500b\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"8bb062dbe58f\"\u003eSame request/response rules as single SMS\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"423c1ba7-df42-4451-b51c-bbaffe6447ff\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"be4d4173b048\"\u003eResponse: id is stored in Phoenix for status check\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"454d0390-5bc3-4d8c-ac8e-f26dc3ee962d\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"bea8a1e1e8aa\"\u003ePackage create (up to 100 SMS per package)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"9f0e8504-b69c-4b95-9a64-6e0083702da4\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"a41821d7-70a3-4bac-b30a-23633699b7c7\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"a8a44bbcd76f\"\u003ePhoenix calls: buffer_import_sms/mulltiInsSMS?company={value}\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"a71a6e45-0c1c-4730-a000-a4996e646a1c\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"c4e4db590985\"\u003eSame request fields as above\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"7aef8845-7f3b-4f9f-a882-d40ffed1dc55\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"5821bfd11edf\"\u003eResponse: buffer_import_sms_id is stored in Phoenix for status check\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"e36dc04a-bbd2-486a-8712-f9b23337ef04\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"cd1a6568d1f0\"\u003eSend all packages\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"ba791c71-411f-45b5-9f92-c09212d22639\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"48ce0b26-b10f-4597-8b79-90437dddf810\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"4ec11e1f6aee\"\u003eAfter package creation, Phoenix calls: buffer_import_sms/sendAprSMS?company={value}\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"9bbd1a4c-c663-4bd0-a25c-3f05f5c88c4d\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"027971f59386\"\u003eSMS are not considered sent until this step completes\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e",
